  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Bibimbap takes about 50 minutes and serves 4. The name means 'mixed rice' and that is exactly what you do: arrange toppings over hot rice, then stir everything together with a spoonful of "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "gochujang",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "gochujang"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " sauce before eating. Each topping is cooked separately so the flavours stay distinct until you mix."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The key is to season each vegetable component on its own. A little sesame oil, a little soy sauce, a pinch of salt on each one. This is the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "banchan",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "banchan"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " approach: many small, individually prepared things that come together on one bowl. Do not rush by tossing everything into one pan."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
